 and D2 (A/A re-check before env knob, GPS-PIN-3)

STACKCHG-GPUPIN-20261022, operator 2026-10-22. Comment only; no behaviour change.
D1: a task still outside cpu_list after re-pin raises ServerDied (already the
behaviour). D2: the ROCr env knob is NOT added to the AK loader until one GPU
AutoKernel A/A is re-checked at the next GPU AK window; then GPS-PIN-3 threads
it through resolved_recipe, unified_planner, production_enrollment,
runtime_identity and legacy_targets as one AutoKernel identity change.

